      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "In the present study, we demonstrated that the angiographically smooth LAD is more susceptible than the LC to an impairment of vasoresponse to acetylcholine, suggesting the more severe endothelial dysfunction in the LAD. We also showed that levels of LDL play a partial but important role on endothelial dysfunction."},
